# Builder Agents Guide

- Always build packages from source; never generate `pre_built: true`.
- A package without a PyPI sdist requires a source resolver/download plugin.
- Register package plugins in `builder/pyproject.toml`.
- Use `Relates-to: <TICKET>` on the builder commit.

Follow [Collection Integration](onboarding/04-collection-integration.md) for
build-needs lanes and the exact Torch collection mapping.
